flowchart TB
  U[User and contexts] --> UI[ORBIT workspace clients]
  UI --> CP[ORBIT control plane]
  CP --> ID[Identity, workspace, project]
  CP --> TS[Canonical task and event state]
  CP --> PG[Policy, approvals, audit and budgets]
  TS --> OR[Agent/runtime adapter]
  OR --> OC[OpenClaw backend]
  OR --> HE[Hermes backend]
  OR --> OH[OpenHands coding worker]
  PG --> TG[Tool gateway]
  TG --> BR[Browser worker]
  TG --> SB[Sandbox provider]
  TG --> DT[Local desktop node]
  CP --> MM[Memory governance]
  MM --> MP[Memory/RAG adapters]
  CP --> SK[Skill registry and review]
  SK --> SKR[Sandboxed skill runner]
  CP --> AR[Artifacts and evidence]
